<title>FRANCE: Essilor first half net attrib rises.</title>
<headline>Essilor first half net attrib rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
